* text=auto
# Unity 会在空 YAML 字段冒号后保留空格；避免把序列化格式当成代码错误。
*.asset text eol=lf whitespace=-blank-at-eol
*.meta text eol=lf whitespace=-blank-at-eol
*.unity text eol=lf whitespace=-blank-at-eol
*.cs text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
# 第三方原始源码、模板与Luban生成产物保留其格式，不手改生成代码。
Config/Luban/** -whitespace
Client/Assets/Game/Scripts/Model/Config/** -whitespace
Client/Assets/Game/Scripts/ThirdParty/Luban/** -whitespace
Server/Generated/Config/** -whitespace
Client/Assets/Game/Scripts/Framework/QFramework.cs -whitespace
Client/Assets/Game/Scripts/Utility/UI/LoopScrollRect/** -whitespace
Client/Assets/Editor/UI/LoopScroll/** -whitespace
